# Committed on purpose, unlike every other env file in this repo.
#
# Astro's env plugin inlines `astro:env/server` values at Vite config-resolution
# time, so a test that imports src/lib/supabase.ts needs SUPABASE_URL and
# SUPABASE_KEY to exist before any test file runs. Vitest's default mode is
# "test", so Astro's loadEnv picks this file up automatically. Setting the same
# values from a setupFile would be too late.
#
# Both values below are the fixed constants of a local `supabase start` stack --
# the same anon key every Supabase developer on earth has. They are not secrets,
# which is why committing them is safe and why `.gitignore` (which lists `.env`
# and `.env.production` literally) is left alone.
#
# NEVER put a hosted-project URL or key in this file. The RLS fixtures create and
# delete real users; pointed at a hosted project they would do that to production.
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
SUPABASE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS1kZW1vIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJleHAiOjE5ODM4MTI5OTZ9.CRXP1A7WOeoJeXxjNni43kdQwgnWNReilDMblYTn_I0
